OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy and breezy start, with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain, some heavy at
OL,7,Ftimes. Cloud clears and wind eases for
OL,8,Fmost by mid-morning, with a bright and
OL,9,Fsunny day to follow. Although, cloud
OL,10,Fmay linger across eastern parts.
OL,11,FTemperatures remaining above average.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with showers of rain,
OL,14,Fclearing by dawn. Noticeably cooler in
OL,15,Frural areas compared to last night,
OL,16,Fremaining mild in cities. Mist or fog
OL,17,Fpatches forming in light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
