OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA bright and sunny start to
OL,6,Fthe day for many, cloudy periods
OL,7,Fforming in the afternoon with the wind
OL,8,Fstrengthening but staying dry for
OL,9,Fmost. Temperatures slightly above
OL,10,Faverage.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FClear
OL,13,Fstart to Friday, cloudier in the
OL,14,Fafternoon. Cloudy periods but
OL,15,Fremaining mostly dry on Saturday. Fog
OL,16,Fpatches Sunday morning, sunny spells
OL,17,Fto follow. Above average temperatures.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
